# Wisp prompts

Built-in image_gen; grayscale source artwork on black, not packed texture channels.

## Wisp 1

Use case: stylized-concept. Generate ONE isolated wispy cloud asset using the attached grayscale painted cloud as the exact STYLE reference, not its bulky shape. Match its restrained mid-gray highlights, charcoal shadows, broad soft overlapping gouache brushwork and broken painterly edges. Pure black opaque background, strictly grayscale, no text, no border, no sky or other objects. A delicate atmospheric wispy cloud, not a solid cumulus, not smoke curls, not cotton hair or fibrous strands, not photoreal, not 3D. Thin feathered masses with selective soft fades and visible broad painted shading; avoid white outlines. Entire silhouette within frame with generous margins. Wide landscape composition. Variant 01: one long gently ascending wind-swept streak, asymmetrical tapered ends, 3 loosely layered broad slender ribbons separated by black negative space, very low thickness, a few detached wisps. Elegant flowing horizontal silhouette.

## Wisp 2

Use case: stylized-concept. Generate ONE isolated wispy cloud asset using the attached grayscale painted cloud as the exact STYLE reference, not its bulky shape. Match its restrained mid-gray highlights, charcoal shadows, broad soft overlapping gouache brushwork and broken painterly edges. Pure black opaque background, strictly grayscale, no text, no border, no sky or other objects. A delicate atmospheric wispy cloud, not a solid cumulus, not smoke curls, not cotton hair or fibrous strands, not photoreal, not 3D. Thin feathered masses with selective soft fades and visible broad painted shading; avoid white outlines. Entire silhouette within frame with generous margins. Wide landscape composition. Variant 02: a loose broken patch of thin cirrus-like wisps, several unequal flattened brush-painted cloudlets distributed along a shallow curved diagonal, gaps between islands, one wider soft central patch with smaller thinning fragments around it. Airy irregular composition distinctly different from a single long ribbon.
